</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">We have included certain
provisions in our third amended and restated memorandum and articles of association that could limit the ability of others to acquire
control of our company and deprive our shareholders of the opportunity to sell their shares at a premium over the prevailing market price
by discouraging third parties from seeking to obtain control of our company in a tender offer or similar transactions. The following provisions
in our articles may have the effect of delaying or preventing a change of control of our company:</p><div>
</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p><div>

