</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">We recorded a loss from continuing operations
of approximately $1.8 million for the year ended December 31, 2024, as compared to a loss from continuing operations of approximately
$0.5 million for the same period of 2023, as a cumulative result of the above factors.</p><div>

