</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">We incurred approximately
$33.9 million of other expenses, net for the year ended December 31, 2025, compared to approximately $0.6 million of other expense, net
