</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">On September 3, 2025, the
extraordinary general meeting of shareholders approved the 2025 Equity Incentive Plan of the Company, under which the Company is authorized
