<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.75in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">For the year ended December 31, 2025,
aggregate cash compensation paid to executive officers and non-executive directors was approximately $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeBenefitsAndShareBasedCompensation" scale="6" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-17001">0.2</ix:nonFraction> million. No share-based awards
were granted to related parties during the year.</p>

